From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Dohmke <thomas@dohmke.de>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] version: tag the engine as 4.7.2.stable.marvin

Sets module_config to ".marvin", so the .NET build reports 4.7.2.stable.marvin.mono and looks for its export
templates in export_templates/4.7.2.stable.marvin.mono instead of the stock 4.7.2.stable.mono folder. The
status stays "stable", so the C# packages the project builds against stay Godot.NET.Sdk/GodotSharp 4.7.2
(the engine changes in this series add API only and are called dynamically).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011LFhRgmAGGsjqJRdhLgNJx
---
 version.py |    4 +++-
 1 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletions(-)

diff --git a/version.py b/version.py
--- a/version.py
+++ b/version.py
@@ -4,6 +4,8 @@
 minor = 7
 patch = 2
 status = "stable"
-module_config = ""
+# Marvin: tag the patched engine so its export templates (4.7.2.stable.marvin.mono) never mix with the stock
+# 4.7.2.stable.mono ones. The status stays "stable", so the C# packages stay Godot.NET.Sdk/GodotSharp 4.7.2.
+module_config = ".marvin"
 website = "https://godotengine.org"
 docs = "4.7"
-- 
4.7.2-stable + Marvin patches
